    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Achama nyu ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo arip osis lapay kirurutkachi löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onkïtunö ye nyu lö, melö ongölonan nko monekwa cho melö kinkït anta kisïwa. Wölo anana chilata ECHOTYON nko owesyenyi nyo wow nyo kyasïwekwa nko wowïntanyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko töngönchintinechi cho kighchï Parao pöytoghinto Misri nko pikachi löwïr ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 14:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko lïkenyi nko angoletinekwa nko nkarinekwa otini kichut chane pögho Nanam nyo Pïrir otini kimi chane kïrïpokwa. Kiwany ECHOTYON chane lömïs. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onkïtökwa kïgh nyo kighwakwa nyinte surkwen atunakwa wölete ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.31+NUM.16.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 16:31-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko kïgh nyo kighchï Datan nko Apiram werpö Elyap cho pö Rupen. Otini kiyata ngwïnya akïnyïkwïgh chane nko monekwa nko emenikwa nko mötworikwa nko kyakikwa kïsïwïyi pipö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kisïwekwa tïkuchoni löwïr echön kigh ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisoyönut cho pö kor nyo kikiyomisï",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïlenyona, orip nyu kirurutkachi löwïrcho omwowokwa asisete. Atonyorunö owesyö nyo olïto koronini atape achenga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atökïchangit osiswekwo ompö koronini kiyomisyï ECHOTYON papotïnekwa lö otöni chane nko monekwa kor nyo chang chö akï wow kumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö karkegh koronini opetekwa ochengöy nko koro Misri nyay kyomöngekwa akatkat pagh opïsoy pögh le pareni onkïyon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo koronini opetekwa ochengöy kï koro kutïngkot nko mpöghoghöy akï kor nyo wow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akï ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa nyo ripöy koronini köny kïtangogh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïlenyona, ato arïpakwa kirurutchï omwowokwa asisete acham ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo apöghisyechï nyinte ompö mïkuliskökwo kïmïkul nko ompö söpontöngwo löwïr, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïkonu nyu rop ompö korenkwa nyo pö sarngatat nko nyo pö kitokot, atemuka ilö paghekwo nko dipay* nko mwaghpa arol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kokonokwa sus cho pö kyak ompö korenkwa, atonyorunö omisyö nyo wow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orip kegh nyu tömökïlïsak amastena apöghisyechï tororötin walaka asagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atömöngwanit nyu ECHOTYON lö kat nko akwa, akïrat ilat kïyam ngwïnya kupot kïgh nyo pito ori, awongekwa nyu lömïs ompö koronini karam konokwa ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïlenyona mowutyeghö ngalechan ompö mïkuliskökwo nko söponwekwo. Arötyï ewunekwo nko tökochwekwo atökïlïkwï kiporunöt atökunonwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneta monekwo, angalana otini ompuröy korikwo nko otini opestoy nko ato omungöy nko ato opöghisïyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akirchï pölöwo kukoti korikwo nko parakuto ortïnekwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atökïchangit osiswekwo nko cho pö monekwo ompö koronini nyo kiyomisï ECHOTYON papotïnekwa lö otöni chane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ompöwölo ato oripökwa kirirurutchï löwïr komwowokwa asete, acham ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo arïp ngalechi alinyö nko nyinte lasiny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïyonöy ECHOTYON puntonichoni löwïr atapaytenakwa nyu puntonichoni owesöch kïtïlokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.3+JOS.1.4+JOS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku nyinkwa kore anka tïkwïl nyo otïkokwa kelyekwo. Kïngetunö koronay le surkwen ntökwitïta Lepanon akïngeta lalwa Yuparet ntökwit nanampa Kwen nyo mi okumpö ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möminye chi nyo muköy ntökïyonokwa. Töni ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa otyogh nko kiwaghat pich löwïr ompö kor anka tïkwïl nyo otïkekwa, le wölanye kiyomisï nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Okonokwa asisete kisoyönöt nko chïpöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lïku kisoyönöt ompö akwa ato arïpakwa kirurut pö ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo cho omwowokwa asete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo lïku chïpöt ato marïpakwanye kirurutchoni, amastekwa ompö aranoni asagh tororötin walaka cho melö kyonkïtökwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 27:11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.33+JOS.8.34+JOS.8.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 8:33-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany otini kemïtwakwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa akïkonïn kor nyo opetekwa ochengöy amwatïta kisoyönöt kwitïta kutïng pö Kerisim, amwatïta chïpöt ompö kutïng pö Epal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mito kutïngkotichoni lalwa Yordan antakwagh okumpö ta koro pipö Kanan cho möngöy Arapa wölo pörtoy Kilkal, wölo lekïto keti More cho tïlilöch. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo karich oghyenökwa lalwa Yordan atape nyu achenga amang kor nyo konokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orip lasiny kirurut cho okonokwa asisete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wop akonga onkït nyo kïsogho Tororöt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
